  <para style="p"> <verse style="v" number="11" /><char style="w" strong="G1161">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G1937">We want</char> <char style="w" strong="G1538">each</char> <char style="w" strong="G4771">of you</char> <char style="w" strong="G1731">to show</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">[this]</char> <char style="w" strong="G846">same</char> <char style="w" strong="G4710">diligence</char> <char style="w" strong="G891">to</char> <char style="w" strong="G5056">[the very] end</char>, <char style="w" strong="G4314">in order {to make}</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">[your]</char> <char style="w" strong="G1680">hope</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G4136">sure</char>. <verse style="v" number="12" /><char style="w" strong="G2443">Then</char> <char style="w" strong="G3361">vvv</char> <char style="w" strong="G3576">you will not be sluggish</char>, <char style="w" strong="G1161">but</char> <char style="w" strong="G1096">vvv</char> <char style="w" strong="G3402">will imitate</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">those who</char> <char style="w" strong="G1223">through</char> <char style="w" strong="G4102">faith</char> <char style="w" strong="G2532">and</char> <char style="w" strong="G3115">patience</char> <char style="w" strong="G2816">inherit</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G1860">what has been promised</char>.</para>
  <para style="s1">God’s Unchangeable Promise</para>
