  <para style="s1">The Earthly Tabernacle</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 40:1-33">Exodus 40:1–33</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:44-47">Acts 7:44–47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p"> <verse style="v" number="1" /><char style="w" strong="G3303">vvv</char> <char style="w" strong="G3767">Now</char> <char style="w" strong="G2532">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">the</char> <char style="w" strong="G4413">first [ covenant ]</char><note style="f" caller="+"><char style="fr">9:1 </char><char style="ft">Literally </char><char style="fqa">the first</char><char style="ft">; also in verse 18; see the footnote for <ref loc="HEB 8:13">Hebrews 8:13</ref>.</char></note> <char style="w" strong="G2192">had</char> <char style="w" strong="G1345">regulations</char> <char style="w" strong="G2999">for worship</char> <char style="w" strong="G5037">and also</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G2886">an earthly</char> <char style="w" strong="G40">sanctuary</char>. <verse style="v" number="2" /><char style="w" strong="G1063">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G4633">A tabernacle</char> <char style="w" strong="G2680">was prepared</char>. <char style="w" strong="G1722">In</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">[its]</char> <char style="w" strong="G4413">first [room]</char> <char style="w" strong="G3739">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G5037">[were]</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">the</char> <char style="w" strong="G3087">lampstand</char>, <char style="w" strong="G2532">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">the</char> <char style="w" strong="G5132">table</char>, <char style="w" strong="G2532">and</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">the</char> <char style="w" strong="G4286">consecrated</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G740">bread</char>.<note style="f" caller="+"><char style="fr">9:2 </char><char style="ft">Or </char><char style="fqa">the Bread of the Presence</char></note> <char style="w" strong="G3748">This</char> <char style="w" strong="G3004">was called</char> <char style="w" strong="G40">[the] Holy [Place]</char>. <verse style="v" number="3" /><char style="w" strong